<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>LightCutSoundz — third-party licences (Rust crates)</title>
<style>
  body { font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60em; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1em; border-radius: 4px; }
  .used-by { color: #555; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences — Rust crates</h1>
<p>LightCutSoundz is built from the open-source crates below. Each is used under the licence shown.
The bundled FFmpeg and its codec libraries are covered separately in
<code>THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md</code>.</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>Licences</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section id="{{id}}">
  <h3>{{name}}</h3>
  <p class="used-by">Used by:
  {{#each used_by}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}</p>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
